CLI.md §3.3, meta/decisions/log-2026-09-29.md "M4 U6-r": in JSON a failed re-check is a cycle too:
its `cycle` line, its findings `added`, the summary; the repair reports them `removed`.
-- args --
check
--watch
--format
json
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

const X = 1
-- step1/project.canon --
project acme {
  canon:
}
-- step2/project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
